<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for your contacting us. I regret we were unable to provide a bassinet seat for you and your family on board QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c}&nbsp;to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We have a limited number of baby bassinets on our aircraft, and can never be certain how many infants are travelling until check-in has closed. Some bassinets may be allocated in the weeks leading up to departure by our seating control team, with the majority confirmed on departure. </font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Also, as bassinets are located at the bulkhead where there is additional legroom, customers without children may be allocated these seats due to medical conditions or our premium Frequent Flyers can request these seats as a benefit of their status.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">All seat allocations are subject to change due to operational requirements, as there are times when we have to substitute aircraft and cannot always guarantee that the new one will have seats in the same configuration.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">These are reasons why our staff advise that we can only confirm availability of a bassinet once you and your baby are at the airport. I am sorry that you were given inconsistent information, however there are many factors at play in the allocation of bassinets and it is not always possible for our airport staff to ascertain exactly why a person has been allocated a particular seat.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I hope that this information is of assistance to you. We do want to make our flights as easy and relaxed as possible for everyone, and that includes small children. I hope we can make you and <b>-<i>INFANT NAME-</i></b>&nbsp;more comfortable next time you travel with us.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>